> is 1 < 2 < 3?
  ucas: (1 < 2) < 3
  note: literal 3 does not fit bool; it becomes 1
0
> is 3 > 2 > 1?
  ucas: (3 > 2) > 1
0
> is 1 < 2 < 3 < 4?
  ucas: ((1 < 2) < 3) < 4
  note: literal 3 does not fit bool; it becomes 1
  note: literal 4 does not fit bool; it becomes 0
0
> is 2^3 > 7 < 9?
  ucas: (2^3 > 7) < 9
  note: literal 9 does not fit bool; it becomes 1
0
> is 1 < 2 and 2 < 3?
  ucas: 1 < 2 && 2 < 3
1
> is 1 < 2 && 2 < 3?
  ucas: 1 < 2 && 2 < 3
1
